    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "A metadata capture output’s [`rectOfInterest`](avcapturemetadataoutput/rectofinterest.md) a [`CGRect`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreFoundation/CGRect) value where `{0,0}` represents the top-left of the picture area, and `{1,1}` represents the bottom-right on an unrotated image.",
      "ko": "메타데이터 캡처 출력의 [`rectOfInterest`](avcapturemetadataoutput/rectofinterest.md) 값은 [`CGRect`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreFoundation/CGRect)로, `{0,0}`은 회전되지 않은 이미지 영역의 왼쪽 위를, `{1,1}`은 오른쪽 아래를 나타냅니다.",
      "sourceHash": "4a6414fefbfda869084719c7aaf896b1fcd2b008fe72a57f513f97f2ff7fcfcd",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0001",
      "source": "The system takes the layer’s frame size and its [`videoGravity`](avcapturevideopreviewlayer/videogravity.md) into consideration when making the conversion.",
      "ko": "시스템은 레이어의 프레임 크기와 해당 [`videoGravity`](avcapturevideopreviewlayer/videogravity.md)를 변환 시 고려합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "75834f908244054618c805ff7321499791acd873510b3b9c6833c2a85b310521",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
